Signed-off-by: Jussi Kivilinna <jussi.kivilinna@mbnet.fi>
---
 crypto/testmgr.c |   15 ++
 crypto/testmgr.h |  501 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 516 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)

